        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "生菜天婦羅蝦塔可和龍捲壽司太棒了！ ！他們還送了我們免費甜點，真是太貼心了。特別感謝Sushant，他真的非常友善熱情。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "lettuce tempura prawn taco & dragon sushi roll was amazing!! they also gave us free dessert which was super sweet. Shout out to sushant for being really nice and friendly to us",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
