      {
        "name": "places/ChIJkafAl2sBBDQR-MPvPelVbw0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WeldXcHJSRTFwYUU5MGVHaDFhVU50UVV0VVgwRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡非常熱鬧，外國人和本地人都經常光顧。氣氛輕鬆愜意，音樂歡快，氣氛極佳。服務員非常周到，食物也非常好吃。我非常喜歡這裡，下次來香港還會再來。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "A very busy place, frequented by foreigners and locals alike. A charming and relaxing atmosphere,  with upbeat music and really good vibe. The staff are very attentive and the food was extremely good. Really enjoyed it and will return on my next visit to HK",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "SA 71",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110468369600027203226/reviews",
