        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WeldXcHJSRTFwYUU5MGVHaDFhVU50UVV0VVgwRRAB!2m1!1s0x3404016b97c0a791:0xd6f55e93defc3f8"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJkafAl2sBBDQR-MPvPelVbw0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rMlNHMTVjbEkwU0Voa2RsRTRkVmgyZW10Q1VXYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡是聚會的好地方。氣氛好，食物好吃，服務也好。他們非常熱情周到，員工也很友善。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Great place for a get together.  Good vibes good food good service.  They are also very accommodating and the staff are very friendly.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Lavina Daswani",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113953717331328292556/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUDwpIXKPGqoavmKtAXDhQRQu9MeBVwTJiHFJWpndZgXAJULA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-07-20T00:17:38.684994835Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rMlNHMTVjbEkwU0Voa2RsRTRkVmgyZW10Q1VXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rMlNHMTVjbEkwU0Voa2RsRTRkVmgyZW10Q1VXYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404016b97c0a791:0xd6f55e93defc3f8"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJkafAl2sBBDQR-MPvPelVbw0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSNlFscFllbmRzWjFoYVJVVlJRM0ZXTjFGck1IYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "We were in for a much awaited catch up and was graciously hosted by our friend Marj. She suggested Cooshti as this has been their regular ‘go to’ after zumba.\n\nWow, we were blown away…..Best value delicious and healthy set lunch in Central, HK. That is what we found out. We had the prawn red curry with rice and roti, beef cheeks with mashed potato and creamy chicken mushroom pasta, preceded with beet root salad and salmon fish cake.\n\nPrawns were plump and fresh, pasta is al dente and the beef cheeks so tender.\n\nThe salad had the perfect balance of a light vinaigrette dressing with pomegranate and feta cheese. So healthy and tasty ….we cannot believe how we finished the big portion!\n\nTo top it off, our sweet hostess Janice (apologies if I got her name wrong) she has the most unforgettable enthusiasm and charisma to the customers that even if all else fails, we would come back to this ever so popular spot in Central. Thank you Cooshti!!!! And thank you Marj!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "We were in for a much awaited catch up and was graciously hosted by our friend Marj. She suggested Cooshti as this has been their regular ‘go to’ after zumba.\n\nWow, we were blown away…..Best value delicious and healthy set lunch in Central, HK. That is what we found out. We had the prawn red curry with rice and roti, beef cheeks with mashed potato and creamy chicken mushroom pasta, preceded with beet root salad and salmon fish cake.\n\nPrawns were plump and fresh, pasta is al dente and the beef cheeks so tender.\n\nThe salad had the perfect balance of a light vinaigrette dressing with pomegranate and feta cheese. So healthy and tasty ….we cannot believe how we finished the big portion!\n\nTo top it off, our sweet hostess Janice (apologies if I got her name wrong) she has the most unforgettable enthusiasm and charisma to the customers that even if all else fails, we would come back to this ever so popular spot in Central. Thank you Cooshti!!!! And thank you Marj!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
